00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:05.364
♪ 'Cause I've been sitting
at the dog park ♪

00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:07.266
♪ Thinking about
all the ways that ♪

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:11.504
-♪ I might meet a dog today, I
might see a dog and be like... ♪

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:12.939
-Aah! Yay!
-Oh, my gosh. There's a dog.

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:15.941
-♪ When I pet the dog,
I'm gonna say ♪

00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:18.311
-[Baby voice] You're a floofy
little poof, aren't you?!

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.612
You're the floofiest,
poofiest, joofiest...

00:01:20.612 --> 00:01:25.718
