00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:12.331
-No. I went to the dog park.

00:02:12.331 --> 00:02:15.168
-Oh. Cool.
I would have done the same.

00:02:16.535 --> 00:02:19.138
-♪ I might meet a dog today ♪

00:02:19.138 --> 00:02:20.773
