-[ Siren wails ]

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:22.241
-Run! Get outta here!
-Oh [bleep]! Run! Run!

00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:24.077
-Just leave the dog!
Leave the dog! Leave it!

